# AXIOMS
## if it isn't a VEN, it should be
## if it effects, its a PROPERTY
## it comes from the store, it's not built into the core

PROPERTIES are the defining factor of VEN in the environment.

PROPERTIES are, in and of themselves, EMERGENT from the VEN which required them first.

Properties are defined first by whether or not an object is capable of that property.
